<title>UK: Uk's Clarke says budget to balance by year 2000.</title>
<headline>Uk's Clarke says budget to balance by year 2000.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chancellor of the Exchequer Kenneth Clarke said on Wednesday that if the current trend continues, the budget will be balanced by the year 2000. &quot;On current trends, we will certainly balance the budget by the year 2000, if not before,&quot; he said in a statement.</p>
</text>
